msgstr "Display Mode"

#. Key:	WindowModeDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(320)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(320)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,WindowModeDesc"
msgid "전체 화면: 화면을 독점해 지연이 가장 적습니다.\n창 모드: 다른 창과 함께 씁니다.\n테두리 없는 창: 데스크톱 해상도로 전환이 빠릅니다."
msgstr "Fullscreen: Takes over the screen for the lowest latency.\nWindowed: Runs alongside other windows.\nBorderless: Uses the desktop resolution for fast switching."

#. Key:	Display
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(326)
