#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(336)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,ResolutionDesc"
msgid "화면을 그리는 해상도입니다. 테두리 없는 창에서는 데스크톱 해상도를 씁니다."
msgstr "The resolution the screen is drawn at. Borderless windows use the desktop resolution."

#. Key:	FPS
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(338)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(338)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,FPS"
msgid "FPS 제한"
msgstr "FPS Limit"

