#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(338)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(338)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,FPSDesc"
msgid "초당 프레임 상한입니다. 모니터 주사율에 맞추면 안정적입니다."
msgstr "Upper limit on frames per second. Matching your monitor's refresh rate keeps it stable."

#. Key:	VSyncDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(340)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(340)
