msgstr "Changes all quality options below at once."

#. Key:	DLSSDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(353)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(353)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,DLSSDesc"
msgid "Super Resolution입니다. 적용하면 렌더 해상도와 동적 해상도를 DLSS가 제어합니다. 끄면 이전 설정으로 돌아갑니다."
msgstr "Super Resolution. When applied, DLSS controls the render resolution and dynamic resolution. Turning it off restores the previous settings."

#. Key:	DLSSUnavailable
#. SourceLocation:	Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(354)
#: Source/knight/Settings/KnightSettingsWidget.cpp(354)
msgctxt "KnightSettingsScreen,DLSSUnavailable"
msgid "현재 환경에서 지원하지 않습니다."
msgstr "Not supported in the current environment."

#. Key:	AA
